      "text": "Resurgence and Mould Calculus — 18 sections: Front matter; Introduction; ``Simple'' version of Resurgence T\n\n**Resurgence and Mould Calculus**\n\n*The documents may come from teaching and research*\n\n16 pp, 18 sections.\n\n**Outline.** Front matter; Introduction; ``Simple'' version of Resurgence Theory; Simple -resurgent series; Stability under product and nonlinear operatio; Alien operators. Alien derivations; Freeness of the alien derivations and first hi; Simple resurgent functions obtained by Borel-L; Borel-Laplace summation; The algebra R of general resurgent singulariti; Relaxing the constraint on the location of sin; Examples from mathematical physics.; Relaxing the constraint on the nature of singu; Mould Calculus; The mould algebra; The hyperlogarithmic mould.; Mould aspects of the MZV world; Applications",
